OL,3,GNEWSAClyde ready for 'heavy metal
OL,4,Afootball' as rock band sponsors club
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Liverpool manager Jurgen
OL,7,FKlopp once described the high-octane
OL,8,Fstyle of his teams as "heavy metal
OL,9,Ffootball."
OL,11,FNow Scottish League Two side Clyde have
OL,12,Fgone a step further than Klopp's
OL,13,Fmetaphor - by agreeing a sponsorship
OL,14,Fdeal with a rock band.
OL,16,FMetalcore act Bleed From Within have
OL,17,Falso co-designed the new third kit for
OL,18,Fthe club nicknamed "the Bully Wee", who
OL,19,Fnow play in the band's home town of
OL,20,FHamilton, South Lanarkshire.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
