OL,3,GNEWSAClyde ready for 'heavy metal
OL,4,Afootball' as rock band sponsors club
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group, who have released seven
OL,7,Falbums, said the new partnership was
OL,8,F"an opportunity not to be missed".
